---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

import { ArrowRight } from 'lucide-react';
import { GradientButton } from '~/components/ui/gradient-button';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Caso de Éxito: Control Parental Inteligente',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-20 md:py-32">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/5 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md mb-6"
        >
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#FFB700]"></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#FFB700]">Joyan IoT</span>
          <span class="text-muted-foreground mx-1">+</span>
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#00FF94]"></span>
          <span class="text-sm font-medium text-[#00FF94]">Joyan Sec</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 text-pretty max-w-4xl mx-auto">
          Control Parental Inteligente: <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFB700] to-[#00FF94]">
            Seguridad y Tranquilidad en el Hogar
          </span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Descubre cómo transformamos la gestión digital de un hogar mediante la integración de domótica avanzada y
          seguridad ZeroTrust.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
        {/* Left Column: Narrative */}
        <div class="space-y-10">
          <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none">
            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">El Desafío</h3>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              En la era digital actual, gestionar el tiempo que los niños pasan frente a las pantallas es un reto
              constante. Nuestro cliente buscaba una solución que fuera más allá de los controles parentales básicos de
              software. Necesitaba un sistema físico y digital integrado que pudiera gestionar el acceso a PCs,
              televisores y proyectores de forma centralizada, pero flexible.
            </p>
            <p class="text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mt-4">
              Además, como profesional que viaja frecuentemente, requería acceso remoto a su servidor domótico para
              monitorear y ajustar estos permisos desde cualquier lugar, sin comprometer la seguridad de su red
              doméstica exponiendo puertos a internet.
            </p>

            <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4 mt-10">La Solución Joyan</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-4 list-none pl-0">
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div
                  class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#FFB700]/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#FFB700]/20"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="#FFB700"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><path d="m12 14 4-4"></path><path d="M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="block text-white text-lg">Home Assistant Core</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground"
                    >Implementamos un servidor local robusto para orquestar todos los dispositivos inteligentes.</span
                  >
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div
                  class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#FFB700]/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#FFB700]/20"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="#FFB700"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="3" rx="2"></rect><path d="M21 12h-8"></path><path
                      d="M21 7h-8"></path><path d="M21 17h-8"></path><path d="M3 12h4"></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="block text-white text-lg">Dashboard Personalizado</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground"
                    >Interfaz exclusiva para asignar "créditos de tiempo" y visualizar el uso en tiempo real.</span
                  >
                </div>
              </li>
              <li class="flex gap-4">
                <div
                  class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-[#00FF94]/10 flex items-center justify-center border border-[#00FF94]/20"
                >
                  <svg
                    xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
                    width="20"
                    height="20"
                    viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                    fill="none"
                    stroke="#00FF94"
                    stroke-width="2"
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    ><rect width="18" height="11" x="3" y="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"
                    ></path></svg
                  >
                </div>
                <div>
                  <strong class="block text-white text-lg">Seguridad ZeroTrust</strong>
                  <span class="text-muted-foreground"
                    >VPN integrada (Joyan Sec) que permite acceso remoto seguro sin exponer la red doméstica.</span
                  >
                </div>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-8">
            <a href="/contact" class="w-fit block">
              <GradientButton
                client:visible
                className="px-8 py-4 text-base rounded-full"
                style={{
                  '--color-1': '#FFB700',
                  '--color-2': '#00FF94',
                  '--color-3': '#FFB700',
                  '--color-4': '#00FF94',
                  '--color-5': '#00FF94',
                } as React.CSSProperties}
              >
                Quiero implementar esto
                <ArrowRight className="w-5 h-5 ml-2" />
              </GradientButton>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* Right Column: Visuals */}
        <div class="relative">
          <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            {/* Main Image */}
            <div class="col-span-2 relative aspect-video rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/80 via-transparent to-transparent z-10"></div>
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558002038-1091a166111c?q=80&w=2370&auto=format&fit=crop"
                alt="Dashboard Home Assistant"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              />
              <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 z-20">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black bg-[#FFB700] rounded-full"
                  >Dashboard</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>

            {/* Secondary Image 1 */}
            <div class="relative aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group">
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603354350317-6f7aaa5911c5?q=80&w=2370&auto=format&fit=crop"
                alt="Niños usando PC"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              />
            </div>

            {/* Secondary Image 2 */}
            <div class="relative aspect-square rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-white/10 group">
              <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#00FF94]/10 z-10 mix-blend-overlay"></div>
              <img
                src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1563770095-39d468f98753?q=80&w=2274&auto=format&fit=crop"
                alt="Seguridad VPN"
                class="w-full h-full object-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105"
              />
              <div class="absolute top-4 right-4 z-20">
                <span class="px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-black bg-[#00FF94] rounded-full"
                  >Seguro</span
                >
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          {/* Decorative Blur */}
          <div
            class="absolute -z-10 top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-[#FFB700]/20 blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none"
          >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
